		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Towering fuchsia golem made of Abyssal steel. Four arms, many legs, horned statuesque head. Archduke of avarice and greed.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 18, <strong>HP</strong> 96, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 claw +10 (1d6) and gleam, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +5, <strong>C</strong> +6, <strong>I</strong> +5, <strong>W</strong> +5, <strong>Ch</strong> +5, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 20</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Gleam</strong>. Radiate shining gold light, all mortals within double near WIS 18+ or blind for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Hellish Aura</strong>. Protected by protection from good (reversed protection from evil)</p><p></p><p><strong>Impervious</strong>. Fire immune. Only damaged by ssilver or magical sources.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
